<title>USA: Telechips reverse stock split approved.</title>
<headline>Telechips reverse stock split approved.</headline>
<dateline>RENO, Nev. 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telechips Corp said on Monday its shareholders approved a previously announced one-for-15 reverse split of the company's common stock.</p>
<p>The split is effective for stockholders of record at the close of business on March 7, the company said.</p>
<p>((New York newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
</text>
